    "updated_at": "2025-10-04T22:07:12Z",
    "body": "Sounds reasonable to. Namely that being able to enable behaviors that builtin elements have, without having to use attributes on the custom element directly (because that is user space), is a good idea. \n\nElementInternals does seem like the obvious place to expose any such API to enable builtin behaviors.\n\nHow do builtin radios get keyboard navigation? Is it not possible to do this today with custom elements without touching the user-side interface?",
