    "created_at": "2025-10-05T12:29:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-05T12:29:59Z",
    "body": "> How do builtin radios get keyboard navigation? Is it not possible to do this today with custom elements without touching the user-side interface?\n\nThey just have keyboard handling done in native code, there's no way to get that in a custom element today, you have to go and write your own roving tabindex and keyboard handling.",
