    "updated_at": "2025-10-09T16:01:30Z",
    "body": "There are some behaviors that as far as I know we don't have any way of replicating on custom elements, e.g. the context menu / long press menu on links and images. You can approximate menus with the contextmenu event, but while android fires contextmenu on longpress, safari does not fire it.",
