    "updated_at": "2025-10-09T17:25:51Z",
    "body": "Well `<menulist>` doesn't require the owner element to put a popover attribute on it does it? Just as an example of what will be a built-in that uses it.\n\nAs for use cases, one is for elements that don't wish to use a shadow roots at all.\n\nI can put together a list of full list of examples where this could be desirable. Others feel free to chime in with your own experiences.\n\nThis is something multiple component authors have asked about so I should be able to find some answers.",
